<article data-history-node-id="1507" class="node node--type-guide node--view-mode-content-above-sidebar">

  
    

  
  <div class="node__content">
    
<div  class="content-above-column-1">
      
            <div class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"><h1>Charitable Organization Initial Registration Guide</h1></div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><h4>Review each step below to ensure a Charitable Organization's Initial Registration Application is completed in full upon submission to TNCaB.</h4>
</div>
      
  </div>
  </div>

</article>
</div>

    </div>
  
          </div>
</div>

  </div>

  </div>

          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="row">
          <main class="col-md-8 col-sm-12 main-content-region-container" role="main">
              <div class="region region-content">
    <div id="block-sostngov-bootstrap4-content" class="block block-system block-system-main-block">
  
    
      
<article data-history-node-id="1507" class="node node--type-guide node--view-mode-full clearfix">
  <header>
    
          
      </header>
  <div class="node__content clearfix">
	  <div id="guide-content-blanket">
		
      <div class="field field--name-field-guide-steps field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items" role="list">
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--guide-steps paragraph--view-mode--default" role="listitem">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-step-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">
        <span class="field__item-text-wrapper">Complete the Initial Registration Application Online </span>
      </div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-step-summary field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><ul>
<li>The initial registration must be filed <a href="https://tncab.tnsos.gov/">online</a>&nbsp;through TNCaB.</li>
<li>The form <em>must </em>be signed by two authorized officers, one of whom shall be the Chief Fiscal Officer.<br><br>&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
</div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--guide-steps paragraph--view-mode--default" role="listitem">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-step-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">
        <span class="field__item-text-wrapper">Attach the IRS Form 990, 990EZ, or 990N, if Applicable</span>
      </div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-step-summary field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><ul>
<li>Attach a <a href="https://www.irs.gov/charities-non-profits/form-990-resources-and-tools">Form 990</a> if the organization has completed an accounting year, and if the organization is required to file a 990.</li>
<li>Only submit the public disclosure copy of Form 990 with your filing.</li>
<li>Do not submit a password protected Form 990.</li>
<li>IRS form 990's can be found on the <a href="https://www.irs.gov/charities-non-profits/required-filing-form-990-series">IRS website</a></li>
<li>Pursuant to Internal Revenue Code Section 6104, an organization which is not a private foundation or a section 527 political organization is not required to disclose the name or address of any contributor to the organization. This information is located on Schedule B, and <u>is not required</u> in order to register in the state of Tennessee.</li>
</ul>
<p><em>Please note, any registration statements, applications, reports, and all other documents and information required to be filed under this part or by the Secretary of State shall be public records and open to the general public for inspection.</em><br><br>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--guide-steps paragraph--view-mode--default" role="listitem">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-step-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">
        <span class="field__item-text-wrapper">Complete the Summary of Financial Activities Form if the Organization DOES NOT File a 990 and has Completed an Accounting Year</span>
      </div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-step-summary field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>If the organization has completed an accounting year and does not file a 990 with the IRS, it will be asked to fill out a Summary of Financial Activities for&nbsp;the <strong>most recently completed</strong> accounting year within the initial application form.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--guide-steps paragraph--view-mode--default" role="listitem">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-step-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">
        <span class="field__item-text-wrapper">Submit an Audited Financial Statement if the Organization has Completed a Fiscal Year of Operation and Grossed more than $1,000,000 in Revenue</span>
      </div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-step-summary field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>This is required if the organization has completed a fiscal year of operation and gross revenue exceeds one million dollars, excluding grants from government agencies and 501(c)(3) private foundations.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--guide-steps paragraph--view-mode--default" role="listitem">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-step-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">
        <span class="field__item-text-wrapper">Submit a copy of Governing Documents</span>
      </div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-step-summary field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>&nbsp;Articles of Incorporation, by-laws, etc. are required.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--guide-steps paragraph--view-mode--default" role="listitem">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-step-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">
        <span class="field__item-text-wrapper">Include a Copy of the Determination Letter from The IRS Granting Tax-Exempt Status</span>
      </div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-step-summary field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>&nbsp;A copy of the IRS determination letter granting the organization tax-exempt status <em>or </em>a record of its application for tax-exempt status with the IRS is required, if applicable.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--guide-steps paragraph--view-mode--default" role="listitem">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-step-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">
        <span class="field__item-text-wrapper">Pay the Registration Fee</span>
      </div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-step-summary field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><ul>
<li>The $50.00 registration fee is required with a registration application.</li>
<li>To prevent delays, before submitting an application, organizations should verify that the application has two individual signatures included:<br>1) A signature of the Chief Fiscal Officer, and&nbsp;<br>2) A signature of another authorized officer.</li>
<li>Some organizations, based on their answers on the form, may qualify for an exemption because they received less than $50,000 in gross contributions from the public. Organizations that qualify for this exemption will not be charged a registration fee.</li>
<li>Organizations may submit payment online with a credit card or e-check.</li>
<li>To submit payment by mail, checks should be made payable to:<br>Tennessee Secretary of State<br>ATTN: Charities<br>312 Rosa L. Parks Avenue<br>6th Floor, Snodgrass Tower<br>Nashville, TN 37243-1102</li>
</ul>
</div>
      
      </div>
</div>
          </div>
  
	  </div>
  </div>
</article>

  </div>

  </div>

